<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CSG Systems raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSG Systems raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Kevin Tang raised his rating for CSG Systems International Inc Monday to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Englewood, Colo., company opened up 1-3/4 to 16-7/8 Monday.</p>
<p>-- The company offers customer management products and services to the telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
